[stderr] +| QB-A-04 | TA | 1 | 2021 Copa América winner — Argentina | Copa América | CONMEBOL |
[stderr] +| QB-A-05 | FO | 2 | 1998 FIFA World Cup final venue — Stade de France | FIFA World Cup | FIFA |
