[stderr] +| QB-A-10 | TF | 3 | The 2007 Copa América final was Argentina v Brazil — true | Copa América | CONMEBOL |
[stderr] +| QB-A-11 | OP | 3 | Order 1984 and 2000 UEFA European champions — France, France | UEFA European Championship | UEFA |
[stderr] +| QB-A-12 | TA | 3 | 1991 Copa América winner — Argentina | Copa América | CONMEBOL |
[stderr] +
